            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/point-set+topology"} point-set topology
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+spaces"}> topological spaces
            ). In passing, some basics of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
            make an informal appearance, used to transparently summarize some conceptually important aspects of the theory, such as
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/initial+topology"} initial
