            %p
              Moreover, all these homeomorphisms are compatible with each other, in that they make the following
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commuting+diagram"} diagrams commute
              (recall remark
              = succeed "):" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TopCategory"}
            %ol
