                    \\begin{aligned}
                    \\text{all points in}\, (X, \tau)\, \text{are closed}
                    \&amp;\coloneqq\,
                    \\underset{x \in X}{\forall}
                    \\left(
                    Cl(\{x\}) = \{x\}
                    \\right)
                    \\\
                    \&amp; \Leftrightarrow\,
