            %h6#proof_33 Proof
            %p We discuss the proof of the first case. The second is directly analogous.
            %p
              First observe that indeed, by construction, the projection maps
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi p
                      %mi i
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p_i
