            %h6#proof_35 Proof
            %p We give the proof of the first statement. The proof of the second statement is directly analogous (just reverse the direction of all maps).
            %p
              First observe that, by the very definition of limiting cones, maps out of some
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
