            %p
              This means that the set of admissible
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi x
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} x
              forms either
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  an
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/open+interval"} open interval
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
