                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} g \in U_{i_0}
                  (this exists because of the covering property). Since such
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi U
                          %mrow
                            %msub
                              %mi i
                              %mn 0
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U_{i_0}
                  is an open neighbourhood of
