                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi g
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} g
                  itself were still admissible, in contradiction to the assumption.
              %li
                %p
                  Assume that the set of admissible values were a closed interval
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                        %mn 0
