          %p Therefore we will explicitly impose Hausdorffness on top of local Euclidean-ness. This implies the equivalence of following further regularity properties:
          #RegularityConditionsForTopologicalManifoldsComparison.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_81 Proposition
            %p
              %strong
                (equivalence of regularity conditions for
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locally+Euclidean+space"} locally Euclidean
