              is connected, then it is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sigma-compact+topological+space"} sigma-compact
              and in fact admits a countable increasing exhaustion
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
