                      %mrow
                        %mi n
                        %mo +
                        %mn 1
                    %mo ∖
                    %msub
                      %mi K
                      %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} K_{n+1} \setminus K_n
              by closed balls refining the original cover.
            %p It follows that the union of all these
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
