            %p
              is well defined (the sum involves only a finite number of non-vanishing contributions), non vanishing (since every point is contained in the support of one of the
              = succeed ")" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
